# LOG_051: Organizational Evolution

**Date:** 2026-08-06
**Source:** Field Observation - Org Design
**Tags:** #Governance #Organization #Scale #VaultPrinciple

## Observation
Mature projects split into two: One organization invents. One organization governs.

## Pattern
Different stages require different structures. A startup and a mature institution should not be organized the same way.

## Vault Principle
**As systems mature, structures must specialize.**

## Leverage
Audit org charts against system maturity. Separate R&D from operations, governance from execution.

